			dependencies: ["6BB23A9836716A37", "0238F574F77C30E5"]
			description: [
				"Grind clay and brick blocks into dust and mix them into fireclay. The compressor presses it, a furnace fires it, and firebricks take heat that would melt ordinary bricks."
