		{
			dependencies: ["6BB23A9836716A37"]
			description: [
				"Smelted iron nuggets come out as wrought iron nuggets, and the compressor packs them into ingots. Wrought iron turns into steel faster in the blast furnace, and every LV hull needs its plates."
