		{
			dependencies: ["33AF6A368B3587E0"]
			description: [
				"Steel plates, a hammer and a file make an empty mold; where the hammer sits in the grid decides the shape. In the alloy smelter the block mold casts glass, the plate mold rubber sheets and the ball mold glass tubes."
