		{
			dependencies: ["6D95C40FFB75ABEB"]
			description: [
				"Sand doesn't smelt into glass in GregTech. Grind sand into quartz sand, mix it with a little flint dust into glass dust, and cast that in the alloy smelter with the block mold."
