			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["64373EE5BFA62739"]
			description: [
				"Rubber needs sulfur, and this early the only source is sulfur ore in the Nether. Steel gives you a flint and steel for the portal; smelt the ore into dust."
